1
00:00:03,470 --> 00:00:04,960
(Howard:)Hey, Bernie.

2
00:00:05,138 --> 00:00:07,728
Hey. How's my little astronauttie hottie?

3
00:00:08,742 --> 00:00:09,762
(Howard:)Okay, I guess.

4
00:00:09,943 --> 00:00:14,433
(Howard:)It's just being cooped up in this tin can
for weeks on end is starting to get to me.

5
00:00:14,614 --> 00:00:18,104
(Bernadette:)Hang in there. You just have a couple
more days to go and you'll be home.

6
00:00:18,284 --> 00:00:21,884
- I know.
- I gotta get back to work. I love you.

7
00:00:22,055 --> 00:00:23,545
(Howard:)Love you too. Hey, Bernie...

8
00:00:23,723 --> 00:00:27,923
(Howard:)...before you go,
can you do something for me?

9
00:00:28,094 --> 00:00:29,394
(Bernadette:)What do you want me to do?

10
00:00:29,929 --> 00:00:31,919
(Howard:)Okay, here it is.

11
00:00:32,098 --> 00:00:35,088
(Howard:)I really miss gravity.

12
00:00:35,268 --> 00:00:40,898
(Howard:)Can you drop something
so I can watch it fall?

13
00:00:42,275 --> 00:00:43,905
Really? You're serious?

14
00:00:48,081 --> 00:00:49,811
(Howard:)Okay.

15
00:00:51,584 --> 00:00:54,524
(Howard:)Oh, baby, you're killing me.

16
00:00:57,690 --> 00:00:59,820
Unh. Hey, Sheldon? Hi.

17
00:00:59,993 --> 00:01:01,753
(Penny:)This came for you today.
It's from your mom.

